  title: Sangam religion
  text: Murugan was the most popular deity, along with Mayon, or Vishnu, Vendan, or Indra, and Korravai, a goddess of war. Hero stones were worshipped, and Buddhism, Jainism and Vedic sacrifice also had a place.
